@startuml state_diagram

[*] --> PENDING

PENDING --> IN_PROGRESS : markInProgress()
IN_PROGRESS --> DONE : markDone()
DONE --> PENDING : reopen()

note right of PENDING
    Initial state when task is created
end note

note right of IN_PROGRESS
    Task is being worked on
end note

note right of DONE
    Task is completed
    (checked by isCompleted())
end note

@enduml